## Control Signals

### NPU Top-Level Control
```
INPUT CONTROLS:
• start       : Pulse to begin inference
• rst         : Asynchronous reset

OUTPUT STATUS:
• done        : Asserted when all layers complete
• current_layer : Which layer is being processed
• state       : Current FSM state (for debugging)
```

### Internal Controls
```
SYSTOLIC ARRAY:
• systolic_start  : Start matrix multiplication
• systolic_done   : Multiplication complete

VPU:
• vpu_enable      : Enable VPU processing
• vpu_operation   : Select operation type
• vpu_valid       : Output ready
```

