## Key Features Summary

### Modularity
```
┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐
│   Systolic   │→ │     VPU      │→ │     FSM      │
│    Array     │  │              │  │  Controller  │
│  (Compute)   │  │(Post-process)│  │   (Manage)   │
└──────────────┘  └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘

Each module can be:
• Tested independently
• Replaced/upgraded
• Reused in other designs
```

### Scalability
```
PARAMETERS:
• NUM_LAYERS    : 1 to N layers
• MATRIX_SIZE   : 9 (3×3), can extend to N×N
• DATA_WIDTH    : 4, 8, 16, 32 bits
• ACC_WIDTH     : 16, 32, 64 bits

EXTENSION:
• Add more layers → increase NUM_LAYERS
• Larger matrices → modify systolic array
• More precision → increase bit widths
```

### Flexibility
```
PER-LAYER CONFIGURATION:
• Different activations per layer
• Different biases per layer
• Different scaling per layer
• Mix and match operations

SUPPORTED NETWORKS:
✓ Fully connected
✓ Classification
✓ Regression
✓ Feature extraction
✓ Pattern detection
```

