## Resource Utilization

### Computation Resources
```
SYSTOLIC ARRAY:
• 9 × Processing Elements (MAC units)
• 9 × ACC_WIDTH-bit accumulators
• Interconnect fabric

VPU:
• 9 × parallel processing lanes
• Function approximation logic
• Pooling reduction tree

TOTAL: ~10 compute units operating in parallel
```

### Memory Resources
```
INTERNAL:
• Layer buffer: 9 × ACC_WIDTH bits
• Configuration: 3 × NUM_LAYERS × ACC_WIDTH bits
• State registers: ~100 bits

EXTERNAL (if used):
• Weight memory: NUM_LAYERS × 9 × DATA_WIDTH bits
• Input/Output buffers
```

### Control Logic
```
FSM Controller:
• 9 states
• ~20 control signals
• Layer counter (8 bits)
• Cycle counter (8 bits)
```

